window.products.push({"id":913024,"name":"XYJ FULL TANG Kitchen Knife With Whetstone 5-inch Handmade Forged High Carbon Stainless Steel Meat Chopping Bone Slicing Butcher Knife For Home & Camp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8104mDfnQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Muli-purpose&High Quality Cleaver】This kitchen knife is forged made of high carbon stainless steel, its blade uses a V-shaped and fine processing blade, which can maintain the sharpness of the kitchen knife for a long time with incredible robustness and quality. It is suitable for cutting meat, fish, vegetable, fruits or any other your favourite foods except bones. 【Handmade Forging Technology】The knives are sharpened manually by workers with more than 30 years of experience by using natural knife grinder. Compared with kitchen knives made with mechanical means, this knives has a longer service life. A high-quality forged kitchen knife is made by quenching-hammering-tempering-clamping steel-hammer-quenching-tempering and other continuous cycle operations. 【Full Tang Ergonomic Handle】The handle and the blade of the cleaver are integrated without soldering, which is firm and durable to eliminate broken handle. Ergonomic Full Tang handle can prevent the blade comfortable to grip and non-slip effect. The pakkawood handle enhances the handholds touch to make the knife easy to hold, so you will not feel tired for using a long time. 【Practical Perfect Gift 】With the elegant box and mini whetstone, it’s an excellent gift for your lovers, parents, friends who are cooking enthusiasts.A high-quality sharp knife is the most important kitchen tool for cooking. Everyone needs this professional chef's knife to cut the food that you like. 【How To Maintain】Due to the high carbon content of forged knives, please pay attention to clean the knives. Acidic or alkaline substances should not be stay on the blade for a long period, and please do not touch corrosive things with the blade. Be sure to rinse it with running water, and then wipe off the water stains with a cotton cloth. you can smear some cooking oil on it If you don't use it for a long time, it should be storage placed at a dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8104mDfnQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XYJ","source_asin":"B08XYR949G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XYR949G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XYR949G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
