window.products.push({"id":913076,"name":"Emile Henry 9\" Pie Dish, Citron Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xqXeU7k+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description This ceramic pie dish gently diffuses the heat to the heart of the dish, baking the food evenly and gently without drying it out. The cooked fruit or meat pie can be brought to the table, still warm, in the attractive and colourful pie plate.When cooking and baking, ceramic diffuses the heat slowly and evenly. This handmade ceramic bakeware has a highly resistant glaze which does not scratch or craze and is highly resistant to chipping; the glaze is so hard, you can cut inside the dish without harming the surface. The bakeware also has a high resistance to large differences in temperature, and can go from the freezer to a preheated oven.Size: 9\"Colour/Pattern: Pastis yellow exterior with white interiorCapacity: 1.5 litres/1.5 quartsDimensions: 10¼\"Dia x 2\"H; interior: 9\"Dia(top) x 7½\"(base) x 2\"DMaterials: Glazed ceramicCare: Dishwasher safeWarranty: 3 yearsProduct of FranceNOTE: This handmade item may exhibit variations in colour and finish which add to its individuality and uniqueness. Amazon.com Strawberry rhubarb, coconut cream, chocolate meringue--everyones favorite pie deserves to be baked in this exceptional Emile Henry pie dish. Pure white on the inside and mossy green on the outside, the 9-inch baking dish with its fluted rim not only adds panache to the table but conducts and retains heat superbly, gently diffusing heat right into the center of the pie. Even after years of use, the glossy, translucent glaze wont discolor, crackle, or show utensil marks. The underside is unglazed to reduce slippage. Amazingly versatile, the dish can go directly from the freezer to hot oven, and is safe for microwave, dishwasher, and even broiler, so that cheese toppings can bubble to perfection. The dish measures 2 inches deep and 10-1/4 inches in diameter across the outer edges of the rim. Renowned for their quality and durability, high-fired Emile Henry ceramics have been crafted in the Burgundy region of France since 1850. Each piece is individually inspected and stamped, and comes with a one-year warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31xqXeU7k+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B00008UA6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008UA6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008UA6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
