window.products.push({"id":913080,"name":"COZAYH 1-Drawer End Table Side Table Nightstand, Clean-Lined Traditional Rustic Style Modern Farmhouse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916eiYWrFhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hit the ground running in 1979, COZAYH has quickly grown as one of the largest furniture manufacturers in the world. Over the course of history, we have served hundreds of millions of families in Europe, Asia and North America, and our dedication to affordable, stylish, long lasting furniture remains. You can find quality furniture designs ranging in style from Traditional to Modern and Contemporary, and we continue to roll out exciting new collections at least twice a year. Today, with our domestic offices open in Chicago and Las Vegas, we are building customer service and relationship to the next level.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916eiYWrFhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZAYH","source_asin":"B08CMPR9HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CMPR9HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CMPR9HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913081,"name":"Mundial 5100 Series 7-Inch Santoku Knife, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ZTRVJ7K4L._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer One of the hottest knives on the market, the all-purpose santoku has become a kitchen necessity. This 7-inch Mundial 5100 santoku, also known as a Japanese chef's knife, is ideal for almost all slicing, dicing, and chopping needs. For many chefs, nothing beats the ergonomic comfort or classic styling of fully forged cutlery in \"basic black.\" Mundial's 5100 Series Black is just that. The company's oldest line of fully forged knives, it exemplifies all the expertise that Mundial has acquired through its more than 70 years of crafting gourmet knives. 5100 Series Black is fully forged from high-carbon stainless steel and features a durable polyacetal handle in the traditional three-rivet style. The Value of a Fully-Forged Knife Mundial knives, with very few exceptions, are fully forged in a manufacturing process that combines innovative technology with old-world tradition and expertise. In the forging process, steel is heated to an extremely high temperature, set into a die, and hammered into the shape of the basic blade. Following a heating and cooling process, the forged blade is ground to create a full taper to the cutting edge. The result is a stronger, thicker, more resilient blade that flares smoothly at the heel to blend into the shape of the handle. Fully forged cutlery offers an array of key benefits, including greater tensile strength, increased durability, lasting sharpness, and better balance and control. Construction Mundial's computer-aided design creates the perfect shape and balance for chopping, dicing, and slicing all types of food. The knives are fully forged from high-carbon chrome molybdenum stainless steel for the best edge retention and sharpening ease. Each knife also undergoes Mundial's computerized blade grinding and polishing process to create a precise taper from tip to bolster (the quality bolster is the main feature of any truly forged knife). Busy chefs will appreciate the ergonomically crafted handles with full tangs, which deliver comfort, balance, and durability. Every Mundial knife is also hand sharpened and individually tested for ultimate performance. Quality Control How do Mundial knives compare to other premium cutlery? In addition to its extensive quality control procedures, Mundial regularly submits its products to an international independent testing facility. These standardized testing methodologies continue to show that Mundial knives are among the best in the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ZTRVJ7K4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundial","source_asin":"B0002LXW8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002LXW8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002LXW8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913082,"name":"Linon Augustus White Backless Counter Stool with Woven Seagrass Seat, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":134.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JrRhkySyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modest and reliable, this classic counter stool is the unsung hero of countless family gatherings. The solid beechwood frame is stained in a white finish and is accompanied by handwoven rush seating as an ode to the countryside. Curved legs are supported by rungs that double as footrests for extra comfort and stability. With a backless design measuring just under 24.4” high, this European made stool can easily be tucked away under a counter or pulled out for extra seating. It arrives in a set of two.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JrRhkySyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linon","source_asin":"B09R2MYLRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R2MYLRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R2MYLRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
