window.products.push({"id":913128,"name":"Tea Tribe Premium Loose Leaf Delphino Tea Infuser By Tea Tribe - Food Safe Silicone - Stainless Steel - Single Cup - Brew in Mug - Diffuser Infuser Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZPUvohYoL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Enjoy delicious tea made your way with the Delphino Infuser by Tea Tribe. You can choose to brew loose leaf or herbal tea. The choice is yours, making tea in the comfort of your home with products that are sure to delight. Loose leaf tea will expand in the infuser, just don’t add too much! Other highlights include robust protection from over-steeping because leaves are concentrated within the infuser. The high quality stainless steel strainer and food grade silicone are dishwasher safe and will ensure years of making delicious tea. Easy to Clean Just rinse it in the sink and you're good to brew another tasty cup of tea! Food Safe and Dishwasher Safe Safe to brew in hot water and clean in the dishwasher. Brew Boldly with unique infusers that suit your tastes! Be sure to look out for different variety of Tea Tribe Pet Infusers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZPUvohYoL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribe Tea","source_asin":"B010MWPM3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010MWPM3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010MWPM3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913129,"name":"Chantal Enamel-On-Steel 10-Piece Set, Cobalt Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WSEBBDCBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Chantal has been producing the world’s leading enamel-on-steel cookware for 25 years now, and along the way we’ve learned that beauty is only skin deep. Chantal’s enamel-on-steel cookware is developed from an age-old recipe that through the years has been perfected to keep pace with today’s demanding lifestyles. Enamel-on-steel is made by fusing colored glass to metal - melted together at just the right degree creates a new compound that’s durable and corrosion-resistant. In fact, it’s so tough that it’s used in high-traffic locales like roadway tunnels and subway stations. The “A” quality enamel used by Chantal is resistant to acids and alkalines and is made from natural materials, such as sand and minerals. Because the surface is nonporous, it is naturally stick-resistant, non-reactive to acidic foods and nonabsorbent to oils. This, coupled with the unique characteristic to withstand freezing temperatures, makes Chantal well-suited for make-ahead meals. But the benefits don’t stop in the kitchen. Our Cook & Serve pieces are designed to go beautifully from the oven or stovetop to the table or buffet. The beautiful colors are guaranteed to make your tabletop beautiful and are ideal for entertaining. Amazon.com An engineer designed Chantal's high-quality cookware, and it shows. Not only is it so gorgeous you'll never want to put it in the cupboard, but underneath that beautiful exterior lies seriously rugged construction. Uniquely crafted of high-fired glass enamel on carbon steel, these pots and pans heat quickly without reacting with food, so meals are safe and healthy. All Chantal pieces are stick resistant, but the two sauté pans in this set have an additional nonstick surface which is also nonporous (unlike most brands), so they won't absorb foods or oil. Whip up a white wine Gorgonzola cream sauce in the 1-1/2- or 3-quart saucepans and boil some pasta to go with it in the 6-quart stockpot. The sauté pans, sized 8 and 10 inches respectively, are equipped with shallow ridges, so foods won't stick and need less oil; a handsome 3-quart casserole dish transitions beautifully from oven to table. Chantal's split stay-cool handles keep hands from burning, and their glass lids are shatter resistant and oven-safe to 375 degrees. Though this cookware's enamel is chip resistant and extremely strong, avoid dropping it on ceramic floors or in the kitchen sink, and be aware of overheating. Hand washing is recommended, especially for the sauté pans. --Meg Heffernan What's in the Box 1-1/2-quart saucepan with lid, 3-quart saucepan with lid, 6-quart stockpot with lid, 8-inch sauté pan, 10-ich sauté pan, 3-quart casserole with lid From the Manufacturer Enamel-on-Steel cookware Chantal's Enamel-on-Steel cookware combines colorful, high-quality German enamel with a heavy-gauge carbon steel core, creating naturally stick-resistant, nonreactive pots and pans that heat quickly and evenly. Enamel-on-Steel cookware requires no seasoning or polishing, and is easy to clean inside and out. Features include stainless-steel rims that protect the pots and pans against chipping, stay-cool stainless-steel handles with hanging holes, and tempered glass lids that are oven-safe to 375 degrees F. Chantal cookware is freezer- and oven-safe and carries a lifetime warranty. Materials Enamel-on-Steel cookware is made of long-lasting, high-quality German enamel guaranteed not to fade, paired with a heavy-gauge carbon-steel core designed to deliver fast and even heat distribution. Enamel-on-steel is made by fusing colored glass to metal at just the right temperature to create a new compound thats durable and corrosion-resistant. The \"A\" quality enamel used by Chantal is resistant to acids and alkalines and is made from natural materials, such as sand and minerals. Because the surface is nonporous, it is naturally stick-resistant, non-reactive to acidic foods, and nonabsorbent to oils, preserving the product for generations. In addition, the surface doesn't require seasoning or polishing. The smooth, glass-like finish is highly stick-resistant, meaning chefs can use less oil while cooking. Chantal's Enamel-on-Steel sauté pans feature an additional Excalibur nonstick surface for extra stick-resistance. Excalibur carries a 25 year warranty. Handles and lids Enamel-on-Steel cookware features stainless-steel handles engineered to stay cool on the stovetop. A pocket between the handle and the pan prevents heat from transferring to the handle. To boost storage options, handles include holes on the ends for hanging on racks or hooks. Larger pots, such as stockpots or casseroles, feature twin Enamel-on-Steel helper handles on both sides. Tempered shatter-resistant glass lids are oven-safe to 375 degrees F. How Chantal cookware is made Chantal pots are manufactured in Germany, where people have been perfecting the art of enameling for centuries. Basic pots are stamped out of a sheet of carbon steel, which is specially engineered to gi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WSEBBDCBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chantal","source_asin":"B00004RD9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RD9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RD9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913130,"name":"Indian Selections Turquoise Tab Top Sheer Sari Curtain/Drape/Panel - 43W x 120L - Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dKmkfXI+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Add splendor to any room in your home with these Tab Top sari sheer curtains from India. These handmade drapes are heavily bordered with excellent artwork Sari Curtains / Drapes / Panels are the perfect choice for those looking for light, elegant drapes with a touch of luxury. It has smooth finish with a soft sheen and feels gentle and cool to the touch. Sheer curtains made of saris allow light in through windows but prevent people looking in when they are drawn. Story Behind the Art: The fabric of these curtains are weaved on a hand-loom in a small rural village in India and then hand-dyed. The artisans are a group of young hand-crafters who have moved from small villages to a big town in Central India and make various home decor items out of these exotic sari fabrics. This gives these wonderful artisans a way to have sustainable income via selling to the worldwide market on the internet. Your purchase supports local and home-based work where the artisans can easily tend to their families and pass these time-honored skills from one generation to the next.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dKmkfXI+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indian Selections","source_asin":"B00DU4V8S6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DU4V8S6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DU4V8S6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
