window.products.push({"id":913147,"name":"Mermaid Balloons, Kelfara Party Arch Garland Kit - Different Sizes Latex Balloons (24/12/10/8/5 Inch) - Mermaid Balloons for Girls Party Mermaid Tail ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715GABVVAxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mermaid Balloon Garland Kit -24inch balloons(2pcs purple mermaid tail); 12inch balloons(40pcs); 8inch balloons(2pcs); 10inch balloons(24pcs); 5inch balloons(40pcs); air pumper(1pcs); adhesive dots(200points); ribbons(2pcs); Arch strip(1pcs); knotter(1pcs); hook up(4pcs); inflatable tube(1pcs).These balloons can inflate hydrogen, helium ( it will float more than 12 hours), and air. Premium Quality Latex Material - Our mermaid party decoration set features only premium latex balloons. The balloons can be left inflated for a long time without deflating or losing their shape. You can use our balloons to decorate events without worrying about anyone getting sick because they're safe and non-toxic. Decorate Your Party With Sequin Balloons - Sequins in a shiny purple silver hue are a great way to liven up any celebration. We've included 10 shimmering sequin balloons in our balloon set to help you liven up any celebration. Decorate Your Party With A Balloon Garland - You can quickly and easily decorate for a party with our balloons. Simply insert the inflated balloons into the plastic strip's hole and secure them in place with glue dots. Our different sizes and color balloons allow you to easily create a custom balloon garland for your party. Pay attention - The dark purple balloon looks like black before it is inflated, which is not a color difference problem.In order to avoid the adhesion of the latex balloon, the balloon will stick to the talcum powder, so the surface of the balloon received is powdery, not dirty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715GABVVAxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kelfara","source_asin":"B0B6ZSWTW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6ZSWTW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6ZSWTW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
