window.products.push({"id":913293,"name":"Vintage Sign Best Chicken In This Kitchen We Dance Wall Decor Retro Metal Tin Sign For Coffee Home 12x8 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MlM6IFcjL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Logo Has Rounded Corners To Ensure Safe Operation, Longer Service Life And Professional Appearance. Each corner of the metal sign has four pre-drilled holes that are attached with nails or rope at the four corners where you need it, or you can stick it to a smooth surface with double-sided tape. Great For Indoors Or Outdoors.it Can Be Placed On A Countertop Or Hung On A Wall. Suitable for a wide range of environments to add a touch of retro humour. The high-quality finish and brilliant printing colours speak for itself. Dimensions 20cm x 30cm (8x12 inch) It's the perfect well-deserved treat to yourself and also makes a great gift to your pals. Welcome To Our Store，Customers All Are Our Friends We'd Be Happy To Help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MlM6IFcjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B1DL71CQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1DL71CQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1DL71CQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913294,"name":"DHP Henley Metal Arm Futon Frame, Industrial Loft Design, Converts to Sleeper, Black Sturdy Metal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vRQa57cPL._AC_.jpg","description":"The recent rise of modern industrial design can be seen in every room in the house—from wood and metal dining sets to metal-studded coffee tables and bookshelves made from old piping. So it’s no surprise that the versatile Henley futon captures this look perfectly, for just about any room in the house! The all-metal futon frame ensures lots of stability, with a mesh base and back to offer a comfortable place to sit back or lounge around. Plus the studded side panels made for a stunning look. The sofa bed easily converts to a full-size sleeping space so your overnight guests can comfortably spend the night. The low-profile frame and compact size mean you can use the Henley almost anywhere—from the guest bedroom to the living room, home office or even the kids’ room. Just add a futon mattress in your favourite design and colour to complete the look!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vRQa57cPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHP","source_asin":"B0765CNDLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0765CNDLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0765CNDLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913295,"name":"LANGRIA Metal Coat Rack Hat Hanger Holder 12 Hooks Display Stand Hall Tree for Clothes Scarves Hats, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+K4JCCleL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"A new contemporary coat rack design for the modern home LANGRIA brings you this new coat and hat rack design for modern and minimalist entry halls. It is a tall, elegant, free standing rack made with premium all-metal structure. It has a sturdy 4-leg base, 1 pole and 12 hooks, 8 of them with an L-shape, the rest are straight hooks. To embellish the appearance of the hall tree coat rack, it has a glossy white finish that matches most decors at home or at the workplace and a powder-coating layer that protects the unit from water and rust. 4 Leveling feet to stabilize the coat rack In order to hold perfectly in place, the coat rack has been carefully crafted so it is sturdy and resistant enough to avoid wobbling. To keep the unit balanced, we recommend you to hang your clothes evenly distributed. Besides our recommendation, the coat rack has 4 levelling feet to account for any unevenness on the surface, adding extra stability. Start using it right away after the delivery The great advantage of this LANGRIA new coat rack is that it is really easy and quick to assemble. Follow the assembly sheet and use the hardware included within the package (2 wrenches) to put the pieces together. Once installed, enjoy a daily usage for years, hang your jackets, coats, scarves, hats, purses, handbags and many other clothing and accessories. When dirty, simply wipe it clean with a soft damp cloth. Please note that all dimensions are manually measured with a possible deviation of 1-3cm. Product specifications Material: metalOverall Dimensions:16.5 in W x 16.5 in D x 70.9 in H (42 cm W x 42 cm D x 180 cm H)Net Weight: 5.4 lbs. (2.45 Kg)Weight Capacity(overall): 26.5 lbs. (12 Kg)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+K4JCCleL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANGRIA","source_asin":"B06ZYL61CX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZYL61CX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZYL61CX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
