window.products.push({"id":913415,"name":"Christopher Knight Home Isabel Modern Dining Chair with Beech Wood Legs (Set of 2), White and Natural","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v7lYsSaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Uplift your dining décor with a set of chairs that easily brings a sleek modern vibe to any room. From its smooth tapered legs to its simplistic design, this chair set not only offers a stylish upgrade but also provides reliable stability with its heavy-duty make. Made using polypropylene injection molding, our chair offers exceptional strength while maintaining a lightweight construction. Finished with warm beech legs, Our chair set is sure to transform any dining set into a refined masterpiece. Modern: Our chair set offers clean, sleek lines and tapered legs to give this a smooth modern look. With a simple minimalistic design, this chair will blend seamlessly with any style of dining table while providing a chic aesthetic. Polypropylene: created with high-quality, specially designed polypropylene, our chairs set is made to be highly durable. Each individual component of our polypropylene blend is specifically chosen to create a unique mixture that ensures that your product is of the best QUALITY. Injection molding: this set is created using injection molding, meaning the polypropylene material is injected into a mold and cooled to harden into an incredibly durable product. Beech wood legs: these tapered legs give our chair with a graceful finish with its bright, warm color and close, straight grain. Made from beech wood, this material offers a hard, tough sturdiness that polishes well and withstands wear and tear. Assembly required: some assembly is required for this chair set. All of the instructions and tools needed for assembly are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v7lYsSaRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christopher Knight Home","source_asin":"B07P2XK7PW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P2XK7PW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P2XK7PW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913416,"name":"Clock Movement Is Compact And Accurate And Comes With Modern Hands And Hanging Bracket (Pkg/5)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vkkk855cL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a great clock movement for do-it-yourself craft projects. The compact quartz crystal movement measures only 2-1/8\" square and is only 5/8\" thick because the factory has minimized and miniaturized the parts inside. The movement, though, is sturdy and extremely accurate, usually to within plus or minus 3 or 4 minutes a year and it can run up to 3 years on one good quality AA alkaline battery (batteries are not included). The hand shaft length (the threaded brass part not including the hand stem) is 7/16\" long and will fit a case up to 5/16\" thick. You need only drill a hole in your clock face 11/32\" in diameter to mount the movement. Each movement comes equipped with a set of modern gold hands and all necessary hardware including a hanger bracket. The minute hand measures 1-7/8\" long and the hour hand is 1-1/2\" long and will look best on dials measuring 4\" to 5\" in diameter. This movement is easy to install requiring only that you select or design a suitable object, drilll a hole in it for mounting and install the clock and hands. This offer includes 5 clock movements, each one with hands, hanging bracket and mounting hardware. For hundreds more craft, art and hobby products be sure to visit our National Artcraft Storefront. We have the creative component you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vkkk855cL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Takane","source_asin":"B000T2CPWA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000T2CPWA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000T2CPWA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
