window.products.push({"id":913493,"name":"Divatex Royal Opulence Satin Full Sheet Set, Soho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919UeVo-+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give in to an enchanted night's sleep with this luxurious set of satin sheets for full beds in a high-fashion black double diamond print on silver. This set includes a flat sheet, fitted sheet, and two standard pillowcases. Smooth and silky with a lustrous sheen, these satin sheets are made of 100-percent woven polyester satin. The fitted sheets feature elastic corners for a secure fit and 14-inch pockets that can fit mattresses up to 17-inch deep. They're machine washable for easy care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919UeVo-+jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Divatex Home Fashions","source_asin":"B004ZD98DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZD98DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZD98DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913494,"name":"Hyoola Tall Taper Candles - Tapered Candles - White Dripless Candle Sticks - 8 Inch (20cm) - 7 Hour Burn Time (30-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ffGt509pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need some natural candlelight to illuminate your surroundings for a special occasion? Look no further than these small taper candles by HYOOLA . They exude a warm glow and a long-lasting flame. PRODUCT FEATURES: - 100% Paraffin Wax Candles  - 100% Cotton Wicks (no metal)  - Over Dipped for Smooth Finish  - Dripless white candlesticks  - Unscented  - European Made  - Long Burn Candles  - RAL Quality Mark for Candles MULTIPURPOSE USE - Candles for candlesticks  - Dinner Candles  - Wedding ceremonies  - Shabbat Candles  - Parties  - Synagogues  - Vigil Candles  - Church Candles  - Candlelight dinner SIZE - 8” (200mm) candles sticks  - 0.75\" (20 mm) Diameter  - 7 Hour Burn Time Why Are My Candle Stick Dripping? DRIPLESS: It's not magic, a \"dripless\" candle, is an ideal blend of hard wax and a perfectly sized wick. But for a dripless candle to remain dripless, burning conditions must be ideal. The candle has to stand up vertically, not even at a slight angle. Keep the dripless candle away from drafts (air conditioning, fans, outdoors, window draft) as well, as a slight breeze could cause the flame to flare up larger than usual or to touch areas of wax that it normally wouldn't reach, causing drips. The candle might not be completely vertical. If your candle isn't sitting straight, it will burn unevenly, which can lead to wax running far down the candle before it hardens. There could be a draft, air conditioning, fans, outdoors, window draft, as well as a slight breeze, can also cause the candle to burn unevenly and lead to dripping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ffGt509pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B08RB7LLC9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RB7LLC9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RB7LLC9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
