window.products.push({"id":913528,"name":"\"UP100Â KC KMCBCP-4 UP100 Line Cleaning Cap Stainless Carbonation Cap Counter Pressure Bottle Filling, with 5/16\"\" Barb\", Stainless Steel (1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QGm1nJJ2L._SL1071_.jpg","description":"To get the best results using the Carbonation cap, make sure your beverage is very cold so that the CO2 is absorbed much quicker. To start the Carbonation process correctly be sure to leave about 3 inch of space in the bottle before attaching the cap, then squeeze out all of the air, and tighten the cap down. Once the cap is on you can attach it your CO2 gas line with a ball-lock Disconnect. Next, turn on your regular, do not exceed 40 psi, and shake vigorously for one to two minutes or until you have reached a desired Carbonation level. Once pressurized, the Carbonation is not lost until the bottle is opened. Carbonation caps can carbonate a number of beverages. Not only can it re-carbonate flat soda, it can turn flat water into sparking water. The cap also works on beer If you want to carbonate only a portion from your keg. It's also great If you want to get creative and try carbonating your favorite juices or teas. This Carbonation cap is the best way to keep your Carbonated beverages fresh when transporting them to parties, picnics, camping, and much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QGm1nJJ2L._SL1071_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UP100Â","source_asin":"B013DJ0R34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913528","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013DJ0R34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013DJ0R34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
