window.products.push({"id":913715,"name":"Urbanest 1/2” Adjustable Wall Mounted Swing Arm Rods, 24\"-38\", Antique Brass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aNUmPqC8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Urbanest’s Swing Arm Rods are perfect for French doors, bay windows, and sidelight windows. Mount them above inward opening doors and windows without hindering their operation. Curtains will simply swing out of the way! You can also creatively use Urbanest’s swing arms to cover doors to save energy, organize a collection of linens, or hide an unsightly alcove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aNUmPqC8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urbanest","source_asin":"B01M10TZX4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M10TZX4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M10TZX4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913716,"name":"Frother Handheld With Milk Frothing Pitcher Set, Battery Operated Electric Milk Frother Handheld For Coffee, Matcha Tea, Lattes Art, Cappuccino - Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OoQJy9uKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Beyond Traditional Frother Handheld] With this Basecent milk frother handheld whisk, you will get richer and thicker froth than traditional methods. This milk frother will provide creamy milk foam in seconds with its powerful battery operated motor. For the best result, we suggest you to heat the milk before frothing. IMPORTANT: To prevent spills, please do not fill more than 1/4 of the liquid in the cup. [With Milk Frothing Pitcher] The milk forther cup including in this milk frother set, is made of food grade 304 stainless steel. This milk frother pitcher is a perfect latte are companion, and it is rust-proof, oil-resistant, non-stick, non-toxic. Also, it is dishwasher-safe and easy to clean and use. [Frother Handheld Set For Multi-purpose] This is not only a handheld milk frother which will bring you creamy milk foam. It is also a powerful handheld drink mixer whick can also bring you matcha drinks, latte, protein drinks, frappes, bulletproof coffee, cappuccino, hot chocolate, etc. [Frother Handheld for Long Lasting] The milk frother’s handheld part is made of food grade Aluminum Alloy, whose material is sturdy and grainy. Its excellent heat dissipation design is more conducive to protecting the battery operated motor and prolonging the service life of the handheld frother. [Easy to Use, Clean & Store] The one-click power button on the handheld frother’s bottom makes it easy to use (no need to hold on the button). The frother handheld is very easy to clean, just put the whisk under the faucet and rinse it. After washing, start the milk frother and spin it to dry. It can stand upside down on itself, instead of holding by a stand. [100% Satisfaction Guarantee] We are confident of this set of milk frother handheld and know you will love it, just in case you are not satisfied with the product, you are allowed to return it for a 100% refund of your money for 3 month. With this handheld frother set, you can enjoy your fresh coffee with delicious creamy milk froth for all day. So, what are you waiting for? Order it today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OoQJy9uKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BASECENT","source_asin":"B09Y1LGVJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1LGVJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1LGVJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
