window.products.push({"id":913739,"name":"NAO Girl Praying. Porcelain Communion Figure.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517hj909ZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nao porcelain sculptures are hand crafted in Valencia, Spain where pioneers in the European porcelain industry have been creating timeless works of art since the company's inception in 1953. This blend of old-world craftsmanship and the latest ceramic technology ensures that each individual Nao sculpture is finished to perfection and will be cherished for generations to come. Nao's extensive collection of more than 300 sculptures captures the unforgettable moments of life including motherhood, weddings, childhood, falling in love, the joy of pets, the beauty of nature, religion and much more. Both gift-givers and discriminating collectors alike will appreciate the quality and attention to detail that signifies each and every Nao sculpture. Nao, part of the Lladro group, is sold in more than 122 countries around the world. Amazon.com A sweet image of devotion, the Nao Girl Praying figurine features a young girl preparing for her first communion. She stands in an attitude of prayer, wearing the traditional white dress and veil with a rosary around her wrist. With its tone of private joy and reverence, the piece makes a lovely solo display or complement to a collection. The sculpture is handmade from fine porcelain in the famous Lladro studios of Spain with flowing lines and precise details. The coloring, which is done by hand, is both subtle and sure and includes tiny touches to the girl's finest features. A glossy overglaze catches the light while adding a layer of protection. The figurine bears the Nao stamp on its underside and stands approximately 9 inches high. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517hj909ZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAO","source_asin":"B0001WW2QW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001WW2QW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001WW2QW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913740,"name":"Zeumuify Automatic Soap Dispenser Infrared Motion Sensor Touchless Foaming Soap Dispenser IPX3 Waterproof 350ml/12oz Electric Hands Free Soap Dispense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716oW1qSmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Zeumuify Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser 350ml/12oz Touchless Soap Dispenser with Infrared Motion Sensor Battery Operation. Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser Built-in infrared motion sensor,detect range is about 5cm(2 inch),move your hand away,it stops dispensing foam right away,no drips. 350ML/12oz Large Capacity Zeumuify hands free soap dispenser has a 350ml/12oz large reservoir that will last you hand washed At least 2 months regular use. One-Touch Button One-touch button on top of the touchless soap dispenser allows you to turn on/off the dispenser easily;Blue light flashes means turning on,red light flashes means turning off. Low Noise The automatic foaming soap dispenser produces noise less than 40db when working,you can place it in office,school,bathroom,hotel! Specification: Type:Automatic Soap Dispenser TouchlessMaterial:ABS,PlasticColor:WhiteCapacity:350ml/12ozSensor Range:0-2inch/0-5cmWork indicator: Blue light is power on / Red light is power offBattery:4*AA batteries (included)Product Size:2.9*3.9*7.5 inch/7.3*10*19 cm(L*W*H)Net Weight:0.45lbs/200g Packing List: Automatic Soap Dispenser *1User Manual *14*AA BatteriesNotes: 1.You can use formulated \"Foaming Hand Soap\"designed for this type of soap dispenser,or use regular liquid hand soap that has been diluted with water about 1:4 ,if the liquid detergents(ex:dish soap, shampoo, body wash) is too thick,it is suggested to dilute it with 6-8 times water.2. We provide 4*AA batteries in the package .3.Please do not immerse the device in water,which will cause it to malfunction;Forbidden to use emulsion or liquid with particles, which will cause damage to the device;First using,put your hand under the nozzle,induct a more times,new touchless soap dispenser needs to operate few times to eliminate pump air!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716oW1qSmCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zeumuify","source_asin":"B08FYQKBZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FYQKBZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FYQKBZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":913741,"name":"Heavy 3kg Thick Soft Faux Mink Blanket \"Pit Crew\" Pitbull Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Au+dPh7L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Regal dynamic luxurious and strikingthe Pit Crew Pitbull Mink Blanket from our collection is all this and much more. This colorful soft super-thick faux-fur blanket is 70 x 90-inches so it fits a queen or king-sized bed. It also weighs 4.6-lbs making it one of our medium-weight pieces. Since it is 100% Polyester it is very easy to wash and air-dries quickly.This means that you can use it as a comforter for your bed as a throw for your sofa or in your vehicle and even as a durable outdoor or camping blanket. If it gets dirty just toss it in the wash and it is ready by bedtime. Featuring several pitbulls against a brick wall outdoor background this blanket is as beautiful as it is memorable. Give one as a gift to your favorite pitbull-lover to snuggle with and you are guaranteed to make their day and their night.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Au+dPh7L._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nu Trendz Signature","source_asin":"B00XQJDZOK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XQJDZOK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XQJDZOK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
