window.products.push({"id":913748,"name":"Ancient Impex Pure Copper Pitcher with 2 Copper Tumblers for Storing and Drinking Water | Ayurvedic Pure Copper Jug Capacity 57.48 fl oz. with Matchin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bdjKTSrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As per Ayurveda, the water stored in a copper vessel has the ability to balance all the three doshas in the body i.e., vata, kapha and pitta. The water stored in a copper vessel is positively charged and is known as “tamra jal”. When water is stored in a copper vessel for extended hours, tiny particles of copper leach into the water making it copper enriched. This copper enriched water has healing properties and is known to prevent and treat various health conditions. Our combo of pure copper plain jug and two matching tumblers is the ideal product to get started with drinking copper treated water. This complete set is made of pure copper using traditional hammering techniques by skilled artisans. Store water in the jug at night and allow the copper ions to seep in the water overnight. Consume this copper infused water as the first thing in the morning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bdjKTSrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANCIENT IMPEX","source_asin":"B07FQK8HZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FQK8HZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FQK8HZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
