window.products.push({"id":913826,"name":"Handmade Flower of Life ORGONITE Pyramid Orgone Energy Generator for Harmony and Healing, with Om Mani Pedme Hum Mantra, Quartz Crystals, Citrine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dCrSsTRUL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"PYRAMID IS ONE OF ENERGY DEVICES and was used as such in an Ancient Egypt. It has been proven that pyramids generate the natural flow of energy circulation in the body, strengthens the power of intention and harmonize the environment. Benefits of FLOWER OF LIFE – OM MANI PEDME HUM Orgonite Pyramid with Amethyst and Citrine Om Mani Pedme Hum Across Northern India, Nepal and Tibet, you’ll often see this main Budhist mantra etched in stone. Whether said out loud or silently to oneself, this mantra will help to connect with your innately loving and compassionate nature. It is believed that even the simple act of gazing upon the mantra will bring about the same benevolent effects. Amethyst carries a strong healing vibration. This crystal will quieten the mind, for you to more easily make contact with your inner self. Citrine is well known as potent healing crystal which helps to manifest abundance and prosperity. It has properties of relieving fear and anxiety. Flower of Life symbol is one of the basic sacred geometry shapes. It is believed to be the basic template for everything in existence. It symbolizes creation and reminds us of the unity of everything. FLOWER OF LIFE PYRAMID can help to connect with your inner wisdom, via the sacral chakra, enhancing clairsentience also known as the psychic gift of clear feeling, to enhance your overall life. Ways of Using the FLOWER OF LIFE ORGONE PYRAMID 1. It can be kept either on your body or nearby, to assist healing and harmony. Glows at night. Pyramid can also be great as a home décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dCrSsTRUL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vajra Orgone Pyramid","source_asin":"B01DROQK04","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-913826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DROQK04","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DROQK04","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
